   "body": "Ok everyone the feathers are real just do what i say and you'll complete this quest...&nbsp; ok u dont get the quest..&nbsp; If u look it is a blue ? over his head ok&nbsp; (which means that it is repetable)&nbsp; ok still with me...&nbsp; which means you get the feathers and just come back and complete it...&nbsp; all right now pick up Deadwood of the North quest..&nbsp; ok then goto 62, 9 and around that area..&nbsp; do the Deadwood of the North quest and you should at least pick up 7 feathers...&nbsp; ok now you know how to do this quest and get the other one...&nbsp; Happy Hunting\n\nThenoob",
   "replies": []
