  {
   "rating": 9,
   "date": "2021-01-21T02:04:49-06:00",
   "body": "Step 1: Go into your keybindings and set a key for \"Interact with Target\"\r\nStep 2: Create this macro\r\n[code]/script SelectGossipAvailableQuest(1) \r\n/script AcceptQuest(1)\r\n/script CompleteQuest() \r\n/script GetQuestReward() \r\n[/code]\r\n\r\nWith Nafien targeted, hit your key for Interact, then hit your key for the macro. You may have to hit the macro key for each step of the quest dialog.  Still faster than clicking.",
   "replies": []
  },
